# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
# Root-anchored: an unanchored "rcptpixie" also matches the cmd/rcptpixie and
# internal/rcptpixie source directories, silently hiding every file in them.
/rcptpixie
# Left behind by `go build ./...` inside the nested fixture-generator module.
/scripts/genfixtures/rcptpixie-genfixtures

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work

# IDE specific files
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# NOTE: testdata/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Go's tooling treats testdata/ as
# the standard home for fixtures, and they need to be committed to be useful.
#
# testdata/real/ is the exception: it holds YOUR receipts for the eval harness,
# and a receipt carries a name, a card fragment and where you were on a given
# day. It stays local. Nothing reads it but the eval build tag, and nothing
# sends it anywhere but the Ollama on this machine.
/testdata/real/

# GoReleaser build output
/dist/

# Python bytecode from scripts/genphotos
__pycache__/
